(card "exp:H-R3b-3_c84_kelly_lambda_1.0" :type "experiment"
  :subj "exp:H-R3b-3_c84_kelly_lambda_1.0"
  :body "---\nnav: 2\ntype: experiment\nid: H-R3b-3\nshort_name: c84_kelly_lambda_1.0\ntitle: \"H-R3b-3 — C8.4 × Kelly-fraction sizing λ=1.0 (R3b sweep mid)\"\narc: 260516a\nteam: h\nround: r3b\nparent_arc: \"[[arcs/260516a]]\"\nparent_lineage: \"[[lineages/arc_260516a__team_h__sizing]]\"\ntrain_nav: 3.6478\ntrain_trade_count: 179\ntrain_win_rate: 0.8771\ntrain_sharpe: 7.6243\ntrain_max_drawdown: -0.0067\nval_nav_mean: 1.1010\nval_nav_sigma: 0.1139\nval_window_count: 13\ntest_nav: 1.4807\ntest_trade_count: 31\ntest_sharpe: 7.3681\ntest_win_rate: 0.8065\ntest_max_drawdown: -0.0043\nanchor_train_nav: 2.1882\nanchor_test_nav: 1.2486\nstatus: challenger\noutcome: test_pass\nchampion: false\noverfit_score: 0\nleak_audit: clean\naxis: [sizing]\npast_only_window_days: 30\nwarmup_required: 10\ncreated: 2026-05-17T03:30:00\nlast_updated: 2026-05-17T05:09:00\ntags: [arc/260516a, team/h, round/r3b, axis/sizing, status/challenger, outcome/test_pass, leak/clean, size/large]\n---\n\n# H-R3b-3 — C8.4 × Kelly-fraction sizing λ=1.0\n\n> **TL;DR** —— R3b sweep 中 λ=1.0 档（即 Kelly 公式与 H-R2-2 同形式 —— `clip(1.0*(ratio/median-1)+1, 0.5, 1.5)` 与 `clip(ratio/median, 0.5, 1.5)` 数学等价）。train NAV 3.65 / test 1.48，与 [[arc_260516a__team_h__H-R2-2__c84_linear_sizing]] **bit-for-bit 相同**，因为是同公式重跑。R3b champion = λ=1.5 ([[arc_260516a__team_h__H-R3b-4__c84_kelly_lambda_1.5]])。\n\n## 假设 (Hypothesis)\n- λ=1.0 在 Kelly-fraction 公式里是\"等价于 H-R2 linear\"的 zero-point；R3b 整 sweep 设计 [0.25, 0.5, 1.0, 1.5] 时把它做为 reference point。\n- 假设是 monotone：λ↑ → mean_size↑ → NAV↑。R3b sweep 出来的 ranking (λ=1.5 > 1.0 ≈ 0.5 > 0.25) 部分支持，但 0.5 vs 1.0 几乎 tie 暗示 monotonicity 较弱。\n\n## 实现 (Implementation)\n- 主脚本：`/Users/han/project/alpha/alpha_second_v1/arcs/all/260516a_agent_team_beat_current_sota/team_h/scripts/round_3b_runner.py`\n- 公式与 H-R2-2 等价：\n\n  $$\n  \\text{size}(t) = \\mathrm{clip}\\!\\left(1.0 \\cdot \\left(\\frac{r_t}{\\widetilde{r}^{\\;\\text{past-30d}}_{\\,t}} - 1\\right) + 1,\\; 0.5,\\; 1.5\\right)\n  $$\n\n- mean_size = 1.179, std_size = 0.350.\n\n## Past-only window 处理\n- 共用 `rolling_30d_ratio_median` helper，strict past-only：`events[event_time < t & event_time >= t-30d]`，warmup<10 时 size=1.0。\n- critic 2026-05-17 audit pass (`#leak/clean`)。\n\n## 结果 (Results)\n| | NAV | Trades | Sharpe | Win | MaxDD |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| Train | 3.6478 | 179 | 7.62 | 87.7% | -0.67% |\n| Val (rolling 13w) | 1.1010 ± 0.114 | - | - | - | - |\n| Test | 1.4807 | 31 | 7.37 | 80.6% | -0.43% |\n| **Δ test NAV vs anchor** | +0.232 | +11 | +0.22 | +5.6pp | +0.10pp |\n| **Δ vs R3b-4 (λ=1.5)** | -0.010 | 0 | 0 | 0 | 0 |\n\n## 风险 & overfit 嫌疑\n- overfit_score = 0。单一 grid sweep。\n- 与 R2-2 重复 = sanity check。任何 R3b 重跑必须能 bit-for-bit 复现 H-R2-2，否则 helper drift。\n\n## Lineage（双链网）\n- **same_as**: [[arc_260516a__team_h__H-R2-2__c84_linear_sizing]] (数学等价，R3b 重跑作 sanity)\n- **dominated_by**: [[arc_260516a__team_h__H-R3b-4__c84_kelly_lambda_1.5]]\n- **dominates**: [[arc_260516a__team_h__H-R3b-2__c84_kelly_lambda_0.5]], [[arc_260516a__team_h__H-R3b-1__c84_kelly_lambda_0.25]]\n- **builds on**: [[arc_260516a__team_c__C8.4__top3_no_open3min_bypass]]\n- **builds against**: [[arc_260516a__team_anchor__anchor_g2__baseline]]\n\n## Reports\n- `/Users/han/project/alpha/alpha_second_v1/arcs/all/260516a_agent_team_beat_current_sota/team_h/output/cross_round_leaderboard_nav.csv` (row R3b-3)\n- [[arc_260516a__reporter_20260517_0547]]\n\n## Notes / 下次迭代\n- 把 R3b-3 留在 vault 不是为了独立 hypothesis，是给未来 sub-agent 做 **\"参数 sweep 等价点 sanity check\"** 的例子 —— 任何更复杂的 sizing 重构必须保留 λ=1 ≡ ratio/median 这个等价性。\n"
  :path "experiments/arc_260516a__team_h__H-R3b-3__c84_kelly_lambda_1.0.md"
